s://api.github.com/users/sandys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5846656342,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJLwiLc8AAAABXHzlVg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arakoodev/EdgeChains/labels/%F0%9F%92%8E%20Bounty","name":"💎 Bounty","color":"4f46e5","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":56,"created_at":"2023-11-26T19:15:36Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T22:23:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"the javascript sdk here uses postgres/supabase as the default vector database. works well. \r\nhttps://github.com/arakoodev/EdgeChains/blob/ts/JS/edgechains/examples/src/service/HydeSearchService.ts#L64\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/arakoodev/EdgeChains/blob/ts/JS/edgechains/lib/src/lib/clients/PostgresClient.ts\r\n\r\nwe want to add support for qdrant vector database https://qdrant.github.io/qdrant/redoc/index.html\r\nplease dont use qdrant packages - use the api directly and wrap them in edgechains classes. \r\n\r\ndocumentation - https://qdrant.tech/documentation/","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arakoodev/EdgeChains/issues/273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arakoodev/EdgeChains/issues/273/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467","id":4799131183,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABHgzuLw","number":9467,"title":"API test script should discover test files","user":{"login":"david8112","id":9345846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzNDU4NDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9345846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112","html_url":"https://github.com/david8112","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/david8112/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-03T00:36:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T13:02:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent Algora bounty: #743\n\n## Bug\n\nThe API workspace test script currently runs `node --test src/tests`. With the Node test runner used here, that directory path is treated as a module entrypoint instead of discovering the test files, so `npm test -w apps/api` fails before running the existing health test.\n\nThis issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```sh\nnpm test -w apps/api\n```\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThe API workspace test command should discover and run the existing `src/tests/*.test.js` files.\n\n## Actual behavior\n\n`node --test src/tests` fails with `MODULE_NOT_FOUND` for the `src/tests` directory.\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nUpdate the API workspace test script to run:\n\n```sh\nnode --test \"src/tests/*.test.js\"\n```\n\n## Validation plan\n\n- Reproduce the failing `npm test -w apps/api` command on the current script.\n- Apply the script update.\n- Re-run `npm test -w apps/api` and confirm the existing health test passes.\n\n## Safety\n\nNo payout, contact, credential, wallet, or off-platform payment details should be posted publicly.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9467/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469","id":4800015978,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABHhpuag","number":9469,"title":"API test script should discover test files","user":{"login":"webmirroring","id":134903864,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAp4OA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134903864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring","html_url":"https://github.com/webmirroring","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/webmirroring/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-03T03:18:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T13:02:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent Algora bounty: #743\n\n## Bug\n\nThe API workspace test script currently runs `node --test src/tests`. With the Node test runner used here, that directory path is treated as a module entrypoint instead of discovering the test files, so the API tests fail before running the existing health test.\n\nThis issue is limited only to the creator of this issue. This means that only the issue author can attempt to solve this issue. If you would like to work on it, please create another issue with the same contents and refer to issue #743 for more information.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```sh\nnpm test -w apps/api\n```\n\nEquivalent direct command:\n\n```sh\nnode --test src/tests\n```\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nThe API workspace test command should discover and run the existing `src/tests/*.test.js` files.\n\n## Actual behavior\n\n`node --test src/tests` fails with `MODULE_NOT_FOUND` for the `src/tests` directory.\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nUpdate the API workspace test script to run:\n\n```sh\nnode --test \"src/tests/*.test.js\"\n```\n\n## Validation plan\n\n- Reproduce the failing `node --test src/tests` command on the current script.\n- Apply the script update.\n- Re-run the API test script and confirm the existing health test passes.\n\n## Safety\n\nNo payout, contact, credential, wallet, or off-platform payment details should be posted publicly.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/9469/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/greyw0rks/bountyscout/issues/141","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/greyw0rks/bountyscout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/greyw0rks/bountyscout/issues/141/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/greyw0rks/bountyscout/issues/141/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/greyw0rks/bountyscout/issues/141/events","html_url":"https://github.com/greyw0rks/bountyscout/issues/141","id":4800989541,"node_id":"I_kwDOS9MLzs8AAAABHilJZQ","number":141,"title":