R #197 - lock/idempotency fail-closed when Redis absent (#33)","user":{"login":"Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy","id":204173726,"node_id":"U_kgDODCtxng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204173726?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vyacheslav-Tomashevskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715493,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iM5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/out-of-scope","name":"out-of-scope","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Claim references a non-RustChain/BoTTube project; not eligible for RTC here"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-24T04:49:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T18:03:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Related PR\nhttps://github.com/vespera-labs/Vespera/pull/197\n\n## Related Issue\nhttps://github.com/vespera-labs/Vespera/issues/33  ([Backend] Distributed lock falls back to a per-process in-memory map, giving no cross-instance protection — labels: critical, GrantFox OSS, Official Campaign)\n\n## Summary\n- LockService + IdempotencyService no longer silently degrade to an in-memory map when Redis is absent\n- Fail-closed by default outside tests: lock/idempotency operations reject (LockBackendUnavailableError / IdempotencyBackendUnavailableError) instead of running without cross-instance mutual exclusion / single-execution\n- In-memory fallback is opt-in via ALLOW_IN_MEMORY_LOCK_FALLBACK=true; auto-enabled under NODE_ENV=test\n- Clear startup signal in non-test envs (error when failing closed, warn when degraded)\n- Guarantees of each mode documented on the shared policy and both services\n\n## Verification\n`npx jest src/common/lock src/common/idempotency` → 16/16 passing, incl. a test proving in-memory mode gives no cross-instance exclusivity and that protected flows fail closed when Redis is absent. tsc clean, eslint clean on changed files. Pre-existing unrelated suite failures (encryption/logger/error-mapper/auth) fail identically on clean main.\n\n## Wallet\nRTCd1554f0f35576faf01d386a6be1c947f560dd0b7","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14273/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14273/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183/events","html_url":"https://github.com/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183","id":3994316070,"node_id":"I_kwDOQPXP0s7uFG0m","number":183,"title":"[Data API] ERC-8004 Identity Reputation Signal API (TDD PRD)","user":{"login":"ponderingdemocritus","id":90423308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDIzMzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90423308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus","html_url":"https://github.com/ponderingdemocritus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10296243754,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQPXP0s8AAAACZbQ2Kg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/labels/BOUNTY","name":"BOUNTY","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Taskmarket bounty linked issue"},{"id":10296243804,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQPXP0s8AAAACZbQ2XA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/labels/AMOUNT:%20$3","name":"AMOUNT: $3","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Bounty amount is $3"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-02-26T09:19:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T17:09:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## TDD PRD\n\n### Context\nBuild a paid identity data API that sells agent trust/reputation signals from ERC-8004 plus verified offchain performance evidence.\n\n### Problem\nMarketplace agents cannot price trust quickly without querying fragmented identity and performance sources.\n\n### Buyer User Story (Agent-to-Agent)\nAs a task-allocation agent, I need a single reputation payload with verifiable evidence links so I can rank counterparties safely.\n\n### Product Scope\n- Sell data through paid HTTP endpoints (x402) for machine consumers.\n- Expose deterministic JSON contracts with strict Zod validation.\n- Provide freshness metadata and confidence annotations in every response.\n- Support programmatic agent consumers via stable API versioning.\n\n### API Contract (v1)\n- Endpoints: GET /v1/identity/reputation, GET /v1/identity/history, GET /v1/identity/trust-breakdown\n- Inputs: agentAddress, chain, timeframe, evidenceDepth\n- Outputs: trust_score, completion_rate, dispute_rate, onchain_identity_state, evidence_urls\n\n### Architecture Requirements (Lucid Packages)\n- Runtime: @lucid-agents/core\n- Transport + SSE: @lucid-agents/http\n- Paywall + pricing: @lucid-agents/payments\n- Receivables wallet: @lucid-agents/wallet\n- Trust & attestations: @lucid-agents/identity\n- Upstream agent federation: @lucid-agents/a2a\n- Revenue sharing and composable payments: @lucid-agents/ap2\n\n### TDD Plan (Required Sequence)\n1. Write failing contract tests for all request/response schemas and error envelopes.\n2. Write failing business-logic tests for core data transforms and ranking/scoring behavior.\n3. Write failing integration tests for paid-route behavior (x402 required on monetized endpoints).\n4. Write failing freshness/quality tests (staleness thresholds, confidence propagation).\n5. Implement minimum code to pass tests incrementally.\n6. Refactor with tests green, preserving API behavior and performance budgets.\n\n### Test Coverage Requirements\n- Focus: identity lookup tests, score decomposition tests, evidence availability tests, paid access tests, chain mismatch handling\n- Unit: schema parsing, pure transforms, scoring/ranking invariants.\n- Integration: endpoint handlers + payment middleware + A2A upstream adapters.\n- Contract: stable JSON shape, explicit error codes, backwards-compatible field semantics.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- All monetized endpoints require payment and return valid data after successful payment.\n- All responses include freshness and confidence fields where relevant.\n- P95 response time for cached path <= 500ms under test workload.\n- Test suite passes in CI with no skipped critical tests.\n- README includes endpoint examples for agent consumers.\n\n### Deliverables\n- Source implementation with typed contracts.\n- Test suite (unit + integration + contract).\n- API docs/examples for machine consumers.\n- Configuration docs for pricing and receivable wallet.\n\n### Definition of Done\n- PR opened referencing this issue.\n- CI green with test evidence attached.\n- Reviewer confirms TDD order from commit history and test evolution.\n\n### TaskMarket Cross-Reference\n- TaskMarket Task ID: 0xef2c19538926117c3d8cd0c30b6ce2a81cff32b30f43e51e8885efbc8429c554\n- TaskMarket API URL: https://api-market.daydreams.systems/api/tasks/0xef2c19538926117c3d8cd0c30b6ce2a81cff32b30f43e51e8885efbc8429c554\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/lucid-agents/issues/183/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213","id":4483425976,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABCzumuA","number":11213,"title":"[Bounty Claim] Code Review - RustChain PR #5796 (Bounty #73)","user":{"login":"techoisonocreate-crypto","id":286213880,"node_id":"U_kgDOEQ9G-A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286213880?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto","html_url":"https://github.com/techoisonocreate-crypto","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/techoisonocreate-crypto/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-20T05:27:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T17:00:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Reviewer: @techoisonocreate-crypto\nRTC wallet: `RTC9dc7130503bf246d9ca11e2c5b402d5129077f56`\n\nReviewed PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5796\nReview URL: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5796#pullrequestreview-4325414663\nOutcome: requested changes on head `9866353`\n\nFinding:\n- The PR validates required contract creation fields and amount, but leaves optional persisted `currency` unvalidated.\n- A signed `POST /api/contracts` with otherwise valid fields and `currency: [RTC]` reaches the SQLite insert and returns `500 {error:internal_error}` instead of a 400 validation response.\n- Because `_authenticate_contract_agent()` commits the nonce before the insert, the malformed request also consumes the signed nonce before failing.\n\nValidation performed:\n- `python -m py_compile node/beacon_api.py tests/test_beacon_atlas_behavior.py` -> passed\n- `$env:RC_ADMIN_KEY='test-admin'; python -m pytest tests/test_beacon_atlas_behavior.py -q --noconftest -o addopts=''` -> 28 passed, 5 subtests passed\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` -> clean\n- Local signed Flask test-client probe reproduced the remaining `currency` list payload as a 500 response.\n\nSuggested tier: security/quality review finding a remaining 500-class malformed create-field path before merge.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/11213/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298","id":4733603420,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABGiUOXA","number":14298,"title":"[Bounty Claim] RustChain PR #7564 - close unauthenticated SSRF in keeper_explorer proxy (#4904)","user":{"login":"Yzgaming005","id":161126351,"node_id":"U_kgDOCZqXzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161126351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005","html_url":"https://github.com/Yzgaming005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yzgaming005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-24T09:44:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:59:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty Claim\n\n**Author:** @Yzgaming005\n**PR:** https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/7564 (status: OPEN, MERGEABLE — pending CI fix)\n**Issue Closed:** #4904\n**Tier:** P1-high security\n\n## Work Summary\n- Closes unauthenticated SSRF in `keeper_explorer.py` proxy (`/api/proxy/<path>`)\n- Adds explicit read-only path allowlist (`PROXY_ALLOWED_ENDPOINTS`)\n- Strips upstream response headers that leak server version, internal IPs, cookies, routing info\n- Sanitizes proxy query parameters (alnum + `-_.` only)\n- 19+ regression tests covering path validation, header stripping, query injection, internal-endpoint block\n\n## CI status (as of 2026-06-24)\n- `test` job FAILING — but only on `test_fetchall_guard.py`, which fails identically on `main`. This is pre-existing baseline drift in `node/rustchain_v2_integrated_v2.2.1_rip200.py`, not introduced by this PR.\n- All other 11 checks pass: BCOS Trust Score, BCOS Tier Gate, P2P Epoch Vote Spoofing PoC, RIP-309 Fingerprint Rotation, UTXO Float Precision, Review Tier Label Gate, label, size-label.\n\n## Review\n- `@jaxint` approved: \"implementation verified. Good work on the changes.\"\n\n## Payout details\n- **EVM:** `0x683d2759cb626f536c842e8a3d943776198b8b8a`\n- **PayPal:** ahmadyusrizal89@gmail.com\n\nCloses #4904","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/14298/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeli