alse,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-16T10:03:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:55:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Code review bounty claim under #73.\n\nReviewer: @kekehanshujun\nRTC wallet: `RTC02811ff5e2bb4bb4b95eee44c5429cd9525496e7`\n\nReviewed PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5362\nReview URL: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5362#pullrequestreview-4303513115\nOutcome: approved\n\nValidation performed:\n- `python -m py_compile bridge\\bridge_api.py bridge\\test_bridge_api.py` -> passed.\n- `git diff --check main HEAD -- bridge/bridge_api.py bridge/test_bridge_api.py` -> passed.\n- `python -m pytest bridge\\test_bridge_api.py::TestBridgeRequestValidation::test_lock_rejects_non_finite_amount -q` -> 3 passed.\n- `python -m pytest bridge\\test_bridge_api.py -q` -> 44 passed after creating `C:\\tmp` locally because the existing tests hard-code `/tmp/*.db` paths.\n- Checked failing GitHub CI job: repo-wide collection is failing on missing optional/global deps (`aiohttp`, `flask_cors`, `matplotlib`), not on this bridge patch.\n\nAssessment: standard functional review with useful CI triage. The `math.isfinite()` guard is a minimal and correct fix for NaN/Infinity lock amounts, and regression coverage matches the failure mode.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9941/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9941/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422","id":4446343773,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABCQXSXQ","number":9422,"title":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5157 focused tests fail","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:37:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:48:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5157 focused tests fail\n\nWallet/miner ID: iamdinhthuan\n\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5157#pullrequestreview-4290358691\nTarget PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5157\n\nSummary:\n- PR #5157 adds/updates `tests/test_integrated_security_headers.py`, but the focused test file fails on the current PR head.\n- Importing the integrated node raises duplicate Prometheus metric registration, and the `/explorer` assertion observes `404` instead of the expected `200`.\n\nEvidence:\n\n```bash\nTMP=$(mktemp -d)\ncurl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/tarball/3c19ecf309897322b4ce88fdeb086ee692f30b2d -o \"$TMP/pr.tar.gz\"\ntar -xzf \"$TMP/pr.tar.gz\" -C \"$TMP\" --strip-components=1\ncd \"$TMP\"\npython3 -m pytest -q tests/test_integrated_security_headers.py\n```\n\nObserved output:\n\n```text\nFF                                                                       [100%]\nValueError: Duplicated timeseries in CollectorRegistry: {'rustchain_withdrawal_requests', 'rustchain_withdrawal_requests_created', 'rustchain_withdrawal_requests_total'}\n...\nassert response.status_code == 200\nE       assert 404 == 200\n...\n2 failed in 0.10s\n```\n\nExpected behavior:\n- The focused security-header regression tests should pass on the PR head.\n- The integrated-node module should load cleanly under pytest.\n- The `/explorer` route expectation should match actual route behavior before asserting route-specific CSP behavior.\n\nWhy it matters:\n- This PR is meant to harden security headers and prove the behavior with tests, but the focused test file currently fails deterministically and does not prove the claimed regression coverage.\n\nDuplicate-risk check:\n- Checked local `submissions/POSTED.md`.\n- Checked PR #5157 comments and reviews for `Duplicated timeseries`, `test_integrated_security_headers`, `/explorer`, and `404` before posting.\n- Public GitHub searches for this specific failure returned no matching duplicate report before this claim.\n- Existing reviews included approval and separate CSP feedback, but not this current failing-test output on head `3c19ecf309897322b4ce88fdeb086ee692f30b2d`.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427","id":4446432535,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABCQctFw","number":9427,"title":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5199 failing CPU tests","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:49:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:48:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5199 failing CPU tests\n\nWallet/miner ID: iamdinhthuan\n\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5199#pullrequestreview-4290453159\nTarget PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5199\n\nSummary:\n- PR #5199 adds `tests/test_cpu_architecture_detection.py`, but the focused test file does not pass on the PR head.\n- The run reports `32 failed, 55 passed`, so the submitted bounty #1589 tests are not currently a passing coverage addition.\n\nEvidence:\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin pull/5199/head:pr-5199\ngit checkout pr-5199\nPYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1 python3 -m pytest -q tests/test_cpu_architecture_detection.py\n```\n\nObserved output:\n\n```text\n32 failed, 55 passed in 0.15s\n```\n\nExamples:\n\n```text\nassert ('unknown', ..., 2026, False) == ('intel', 'pentium4', 2000, False)\nassert ('intel', 'modern_intel', 2020, True) == ('intel', 'sandy_bridge', 2011, True)\nassert ('amd', 'modern_amd', 2020, True) == ('amd', 'zen2', 2019, True)\n```\n\nExpected behavior:\n- The focused test suite should pass on the PR head before it is assessed as usable bounty #1589 coverage.\n- Either the expected values should match the current implementation, or the PR should include implementation changes that make the new expected behavior true.\n\nDuplicate-risk check:\n- Checked local `submissions/POSTED.md`.\n- Checked PR #5199 comments and reviews for `32 failed`, `test_cpu_architecture_detection`, `Pentium`, and `modern_intel`; no duplicate review found before posting.\n- Public search for PR #5199 plus failure terms did not find a matching duplicate report before this claim.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9427/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434","id":4446727615,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABCQutvw","number":9434,"title":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5208 failing badge-generator tests","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-14T14:29:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:48:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Review bounty #73 claim: RustChain PR #5208 failing badge-generator tests\n\nWallet/miner ID: iamdinhthuan\n\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5208#pullrequestreview-4290752929\nTarget PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5208\n\nSummary:\n- PR #5208 adds an auth gate to `/api/badge/generate`, but does not update the existing focused Flask route tests.\n- The authenticated success/validation tests now hit the new missing-admin-key branch and fail with `500` instead of exercising the intended badge generation validation behavior.\n\nEvidence:\n\n```bash\nPYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1 /tmp/bottube-issue999-venv/bin/python -m pytest -q \\\n  tests/test_bcos_badge_generator.py::TestFlaskIntegration::test_generate_badge_success \\\n  tests/test_bcos_badge_generator.py::TestFlaskIntegration::test_generate_badge_missing_repo \\\n  tests/test_bcos_badge_generator.py::TestFlaskIntegration::test_generate_badge_invalid_tier \\\n  tests/test_bcos_badge_generator.py::TestFlaskIntegration::test_generate_badge_invalid_score \\\n  tests/test_bcos_badge_generator.py::TestFlaskIntegration::test_generate_badge_rejects_non_numeric_score\n```\n\nObserved output:\n\n```text\n7 failed, 1 passed in 0.11s\nAssertionError: 500 != 200\n```\n\nExpected behavior:\n- Existing route validation tests should be updated to configure `BCOS_ADMIN_KEY` and send a valid `X-Admin-Key` for authenticated cases.\n- The PR should also add explicit tests for missing admin config and wrong admin key.\n\nDuplicate-risk check:\n- Checked local `submissions/POSTED.md` and `docs/WORKLOG.md`.\n- Checked PR #5208 comments/reviews before posting; no duplicate review existed.\n- GitHub search for PR #5208 plus `test_bcos_badge_generator` / `500 != 200` terms did not show a matching duplicate report before this claim.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448","id":4447301612,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABCRRv7A","number":9448,"title":"Review bounty #73 claim: rustchain-bounties PR #9442 failing tests","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-14T15:52:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:47:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Review bounty #73 claim: rustchain-bounties PR #9442 failing tests\n\nWallet/miner ID: iamdinhthuan\n\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/9442#pullrequestreview-4291359702\nTarget PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/9442\n\nSummary:\n- PR #9442 adds three new unit test files, but the new focused test suite fails on the PR head.\n- Failures come from an import mismatch for `scripts/auto-pay.py`, a wallet regex expectation that is shadowed by the broad fallback, and an impossible arbitrary roundtrip assertion for the modulo word encoder.\n\nEvidence:\n\n```bash\nPYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1 python3 -m pytest -q \\\n  tests/test_auto_pay.py tests/test_verify_bounties.py tests/test_wallet_helpers.py\n```\n\nObserved output:\n\n```text\n2 failed, 43 passed, 8 errors in 7.26s\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'auto_pay'\nAssertionError: assert result[0][\"wallet\"].startswith(\"RTC\")\nAssertionError: assert restored == original\n```\n\nExpected behavior:\n- The new tests should be importable and pass against the repository helpers they target.\n\nDuplicate-risk check:\n- Checked local `submissions/POSTED.md` and `docs/WORKLOG.md` for PR #9442 before posting.\n- Checked PR #9442 comments/reviews; no prior review or comment existed.\n- GitHub search for PR #9442 plus `auto_pay`, `ModuleNotFoundError`, and wallet roundtrip terms did not show a matching duplicate report before posting.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/9448/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623","id":4464049517,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABChP9bQ","number":10623,"title":"[Bounty Claim] UTXO caller-owned connection preservation (PR #5572)","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-17T16:00:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty route\n- Primary bounty: Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties#2819\n- Fix PR: Scottcjn/Rustchain#5572\n- Miner / payout id: iamdinhthuan\n\n## Summary\n`UtxoDB.apply_transaction()` accepts a caller-supplied SQLite connection. On the rejected unauthorized `mining_reward` guard path, the current code closes that caller-owned connection before returning `False`. That turns a normal validation failure into `sqlite3.ProgrammingError: Cannot operate on a closed database` for callers that need to inspect, roll back, or continue their own transaction.\n\nPR #5572 removes the external-connection close on that guard path and adds a regression proving the caller-owned connection remains usable after the rejected mint attempt.\n\n## Verification\nRan before filing this claim:\n\n```bash\n# RED, test-only patch on current main\npython3 -m pytest node/test_utxo_db.py::TestUtxoDB::test_user_supplied_mining_reward_preserves_external_conn node/test_utxo_db.py::TestUtxoDB::test_user_supplied_mining_reward_rejected_before_opening_db -q\n```\n\nObserved: `test_user_supplied_mining_reward_preserves_external_conn` failed because `apply_transaction` closed the caller-owned connection.\n\n```bash\n# GREEN, full patch\npython3 -m pytest node/test_utxo_db.py::TestUtxoDB::test_user_supplied_mining_reward_preserves_external_conn node/test_utxo_db.py::TestUtxoDB::test_user_supplied_mining_reward_rejected_before_opening_db node/test_utxo_db.py -q\npython3 -m py_compile node/utxo_db.py node/test_utxo_db.py\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nObserved: `72 passed`, py_compile passed, and `git diff --check` was clean.\n\n## Duplicate check\nI searched public issues/PRs for `caller-owned connection apply_transaction mining_reward`, `external conn close apply_transaction mining_reward`, and `preserve external connection apply_transaction`. I did not find an exact duplicate. Open PR #4638 is about unmineable mempool outputs, not this external-connection ownership path.\n\nNo private keys, tokens, credentials, or account-internal data are included.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10623/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638","id":4464108772,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABChTk5A","number":10638,"title":"[Bounty Claim] Payout worker manual recovery for ambiguous withdrawals (PR #5577)","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-17T16:18:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:46:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty route\n- Primary bounty: Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties#71\n- Reported issue: Scottcjn/Rustchain#5346\n- Fix PR: Scottcjn/Rustchain#5577\n- Miner / payout id: iamdinhthuan\n\n## Summary\nAfter `PayoutWorker.process_withdrawal()` deducts balance and marks a withdrawal `processing`, an exception during broadcast or completion leaves transaction status ambiguous. The current path refunds the account and marks the withdrawal failed, which can double-pay if the external transfer actually broadcast before the worker crashed or lost the response.\n\nPR #5577 changes post-deduction failures and startup-orphaned `processing` rows to an explicit `recovery_required` state. It does not refund automatically; operators must verify transaction status before retrying or refunding. The worker stats now expose `recovery_required` rows.\n\n## Verification\nRan before filing this claim:\n\n```bash\n# RED, test-only patches on current main\npython3 -m pytest tests/test_payout_worker_production_noop.py::test_processing_withdrawal_failure_requires_manual_recovery_without_refund -q\npython3 -m pytest tests/test_payout_worker_production_noop.py::test_startup_recovery_moves_processing_withdrawals_to_manual_review_without_refund -q\n```\n\nObserved: first red failed with `assert 100 == 89`, proving the old code refunded the deducted amount; second red failed with missing `recover_processing_withdrawals`.\n\n```bash\n# GREEN, full patch\npython3 -m pytest tests/test_payout_worker_production_noop.py -q\npython3 -m py_compile node/payout_worker.py tests/test_payout_worker_production_noop.py\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nObserved: `4 passed`, py_compile passed, and `git diff --check` was clean.\n\n## Duplicate check\nI searched public RustChain PRs and bounty claims for `5346`, `payout_worker`, `recover_processing_withdrawals`, `recovery_required`, and `worker restart verify transaction status before retrying or refunding`. I found no matching PR for issue #5346 and no exact bounty claim for this payout-worker recovery route.\n\nNo private keys, tokens, credentials, account cookies, or account-internal data are included.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10638/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10700","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10700/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10700/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10700/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/10700","id":4464426577,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABChm-UQ","number":10700,"title":"[Bounty Claim] Broken Legend of Elya link fix (PR #5584)","user":{"login":"iamdinhthuan","id":92212551,"node_id":"U_kgDOBX8NRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92212551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan","html_url":"https://github.com/iamdinhthuan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamdinhthuan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11336715403,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACo7iMiw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/over-cap","name":"over-cap","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"Real work, but claims exceed per-contributor per-bounty cap; tracked, paid to cap"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-05-17T17:53:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T16:45:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"GitHub: @iamdinhthuan\nWallet/miner ID: `iamdinhthuan`\n\nBounty: #444 - Find a Typo or Broken Link\nPull request: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pull/5584\nPR head: `3cd20e86fbcbb3e613d67ee861a3067c93ed387b`\n\nSummary:\n- Updated the console mining setup reference from the dead `https://github.com/ilya-kh/legend-of-elya` repository to the live `https://github.com/Scottcjn/legend-of-elya-n64` repository.\n- Scope is one documentation line in `docs/CONSOLE_MINING_SETUP.md`.\n\nValidation:\n```text\ncurl -sS -L -o /dev/null -w \"old %{http_code} %{url_effective}\\n\" https://github.com/ilya-kh/legend-of-elya\n# old 404 https://github.com/ilya-kh/legend-of-elya\n\ncurl -sS -L -o /dev/null -w \"new %{http_code} %{url_effective}\\n\" https://github.com/Scottcjn/legend-of-elya-n64\n# new 200 https://github.com/Scottcjn/legend-of-elya-n64\n\ngit diff --check origin/main...HEAD -- docs/CONSOLE_MINING_SETUP.md\n# passed\n\npython3 tools/bcos_spdx_check.py --base-ref origin/main\n# BCOS SPDX check: OK\n```\n\nCI note:\nThe PR metadata/BCOS/link-scoped checks are green except the repo-wide `test` job, which is still failing on the existing broad-suite baseline unrelated to this one-line documentation link fix.\n\nDuplicate check:\nBefore filing this claim, I searched rustchain-bounties for existing same-account `PR #5584`, `pull/5584`, `docs/CONSOLE_MINING_SETUP.md`, and `ilya-kh/legend-of-elya` claims and found no matching live claim by @iamdinhthuan. The visible #10682 issue is a third-party PR review claim, not this broken-link fix claim.\n\nSafety:\nNo private keys, tokens, wallet secrets, production services, live wallet actions, withdrawals, or fund movement were used. This claim does not assert accepted, paid, confirmed, or withdrawable RTC/wRTC.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issu